; Do not fill this in without asking whether the realm needs another beat here.
;
; FINISH RUN (2026-09-27): the Storm Tyrant's duelling ground, levelled by Area_stormcrown_arena at
; cell-local (20, 45) and kept bare by Exclusion_stormcrown_arena. A ring of ruined pillars, the
; challenge brazier on the west side where the track arrives, four add spawns, and storm lights the
; fight reveals as it escalates.
